{"id":"vol9-08","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-08/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":338.01,"segments":[{"start":3.41,"end":8.03,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["Now",3.41,3.97],["listen",3.97,4.27],["carefully",4.27,4.71],["and",4.71,5.33],["answer",5.33,5.69],["questions",5.69,6.01],["21",6.01,6.85],["to",6.85,7.35],["24.",7.35,8.03]]},{"start":11.38,"end":13.74,"text":"Hi Scott, here are my notes.","words":[["Hi",11.38,11.94],["Scott,",11.94,12.22],["here",12.9,13.16],["are",13.16,13.28],["my",13.28,13.36],["notes.",13.36,13.74]]},{"start":14.44,"end":16.08,"text":"Let's sort this presentation out then.","words":[["Let's",14.44,14.8],["sort",14.8,14.94],["this",14.94,15.08],["presentation",15.08,15.58],["out",15.58,15.88],["then.",15.88,16.08]]},{"start":16.56,"end":20.76,"text":"The first thing I found out about Stonepoint is it's an extinct volcanic cone.","words":[["The",16.56,16.98],["first",16.98,17.22],["thing",17.22,17.36],["I",17.36,17.46],["found",17.46,17.7],["out",17.7,17.9],["about",17.9,18.12],["Stonepoint",18.12,18.68],["is",18.68,19.0],["it's",19.0,19.18],["an",19.18,19.3],["extinct",19.3,19.68],["volcanic",19.68,20.26],["cone.",20.26,20.76]]},{"start":21.1,"end":23.04,"text":"You probably know that already, being a New Zealander.","words":[["You",21.1,21.22],["probably",21.22,21.46],["know",21.46,21.74],["that",21.74,21.88],["already,",21.88,22.24],["being",22.24,22.48],["a",22.48,22.6],["New",22.6,22.68],["Zealander.",22.68,23.04]]},{"start":23.3,"end":27.48,"text":"Yes, and there are two other cones nearby, which also overlook the harbour.","words":[["Yes,",23.3,23.52],["and",23.62,23.78],["there",23.78,23.92],["are",23.92,24.02],["two",24.02,24.28],["other",24.28,24.54],["cones",24.54,24.82],["nearby,",24.82,25.26],["which",25.66,26.04],["also",26.04,26.56],["overlook",26.56,26.9],["the",26.9,27.18],["harbour.",27.18,27.48]]},{"start":27.76,"end":28.1,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",27.76,28.1]]},{"start":28.96,"end":35.94,"text":"Yeah, the first settlers of New Zealand, the Maori, sailed to New Zealand thousands of years after these volcanoes erupted.","words":[["Yeah,",28.96,29.26],["the",29.44,29.6],["first",29.6,29.82],["settlers",29.82,30.08],["of",30.08,30.36],["New",30.36,30.5],["Zealand,",30.5,30.9],["the",31.22,31.36],["Maori,",31.36,31.64],["sailed",32.2,32.54],["to",32.54,32.78],["New",32.78,32.9],["Zealand",32.9,33.28],["thousands",33.28,33.82],["of",33.82,34.1],["years",34.1,34.28],["after",34.28,34.76],["these",34.76,34.98],["volcanoes",34.98,35.38],["erupted.",35.38,35.94]]},{"start":35.94,"end":42.54,"text":"I think the Tudor allocated us this topic though, because of stone points significant historical","words":[["I",35.94,37.06],["think",37.06,37.24],["the",37.24,37.42],["Tudor",37.42,37.76],["allocated",37.76,38.22],["us",38.22,38.54],["this",38.54,38.76],["topic",38.76,39.1],["though,",39.1,39.4],["because",39.84,40.12],["of",40.12,40.3],["stone",40.3,40.66],["points",40.66,41.12],["significant",41.12,41.76],["historical",41.76,42.54]]},{"start":42.54,"end":42.98,"text":"role.","words":[["role.",42.54,42.98]]},{"start":43.5,"end":48.84,"text":"It's been used by both Māori and European settlers as a place to shelter from attack","words":[["It's",43.5,43.84],["been",43.84,43.98],["used",43.98,44.26],["by",44.26,44.5],["both",44.5,44.74],["Māori",44.74,45.14],["and",45.14,45.84],["European",45.84,46.2],["settlers",46.2,46.7],["as",46.7,47.24],["a",47.24,47.34],["place",47.34,47.54],["to",47.54,47.76],["shelter",47.76,48.1],["from",48.1,48.4],["attack",48.4,48.84]]},{"start":48.84,"end":51.14,"text":"or launch an attack for centuries.","words":[["or",48.84,49.38],["launch",49.38,49.72],["an",49.72,49.92],["attack",49.92,50.24],["for",50.24,50.72],["centuries.",50.72,51.14]]},{"start":51.84,"end":56.4,"text":"Yeah, and the fact it was an ideal place for building a village, it would have been quite","words":[["Yeah,",51.84,52.12],["and",52.62,52.82],["the",52.82,52.94],["fact",52.94,53.16],["it",53.16,53.3],["was",53.3,53.42],["an",53.42,53.56],["ideal",53.56,53.82],["place",53.82,54.18],["for",54.18,54.42],["building",54.42,54.68],["a",54.68,54.84],["village,",54.84,55.22],["it",55.46,55.8],["would",55.8,55.88],["have",55.88,55.98],["been",55.98,56.14],["quite",56.14,56.4]]},{"start":56.4,"end":57.24,"text":"a sheltered spot.","words":[["a",56.4,56.5],["sheltered",56.5,57.02],["spot.",57.02,57.24]]},{"start":57.82,"end":62.0,"text":"I suppose the Māori settled there because they thought the volcanic soil would help","words":[["I",57.82,58.2],["suppose",58.2,58.46],["the",58.46,58.76],["Māori",58.76,58.98],["settled",58.98,59.28],["there",59.28,59.64],["because",59.64,59.92],["they",59.92,60.12],["thought",60.12,60.34],["the",60.34,60.5],["volcanic",60.5,60.82],["soil",60.82,61.44],["would",61.44,61.74],["help",61.74,62.0]]},{"start":62.0,"end":62.86,"text":"their crops grow.","words":[["their",62.0,62.22],["crops",62.22,62.5],["grow.",62.5,62.86]]},{"start":62.86,"end":66.58,"text":"well they would have realized the benefits of the soil after a few good","words":[["well",62.86,63.04],["they",63.04,64.1],["would",64.1,64.26],["have",64.26,64.38],["realized",64.38,64.68],["the",64.68,64.9],["benefits",64.9,65.2],["of",65.2,65.42],["the",65.42,65.54],["soil",65.54,65.78],["after",65.78,66.08],["a",66.08,66.28],["few",66.28,66.4],["good",66.4,66.58]]},{"start":66.58,"end":70.04,"text":"harvests but initially the fishing opportunities would have been the","words":[["harvests",66.58,67.04],["but",67.04,67.74],["initially",67.74,68.12],["the",68.12,68.4],["fishing",68.4,68.72],["opportunities",68.72,69.42],["would",69.42,69.66],["have",69.66,69.76],["been",69.76,69.9],["the",69.9,70.04]]},{"start":70.04,"end":75.9,"text":"attraction. You're right. Actually I also read that Maori regard stone point as","words":[["attraction.",70.04,70.4],["You're",71.02,71.48],["right.",71.48,71.72],["Actually",72.76,73.08],["I",73.08,73.5],["also",73.5,73.78],["read",73.78,74.06],["that",74.06,74.26],["Maori",74.26,74.54],["regard",74.54,74.98],["stone",74.98,75.28],["point",75.28,75.64],["as",75.64,75.9]]},{"start":75.9,"end":82.28,"text":"taunga. I believe that means a treasured thing. Well your Maori vocabulary is","words":[["taunga.",75.9,76.84],["I",77.46,77.56],["believe",77.56,77.76],["that",77.76,78.0],["means",78.0,78.28],["a",78.28,78.6],["treasured",78.6,79.24],["thing.",79.24,79.46],["Well",80.1,80.42],["your",80.42,81.02],["Maori",81.02,81.36],["vocabulary",81.36,81.84],["is",81.84,82.28]]},{"start":82.28,"end":88.26,"text":"improving Scotch. We do have to deal with stone points cultural value for","words":[["improving",82.28,82.72],["Scotch.",82.72,84.16],["We",84.16,84.66],["do",84.66,85.52],["have",85.52,85.74],["to",85.74,85.86],["deal",85.86,86.08],["with",86.08,86.3],["stone",86.3,86.58],["points",86.58,86.92],["cultural",86.92,87.44],["value",87.44,88.0],["for",88.0,88.26]]},{"start":88.26,"end":93.94,"text":"Māori. That's still part of its historical significance. But we need to keep most Māori","words":[["Māori.",88.26,88.52],["That's",89.04,89.46],["still",89.46,89.64],["part",89.64,89.9],["of",89.9,90.06],["its",90.06,90.18],["historical",90.18,90.82],["significance.",90.82,91.52],["But",92.3,92.5],["we",92.5,92.62],["need",92.62,92.8],["to",92.8,92.94],["keep",92.94,93.16],["most",93.16,93.56],["Māori",93.56,93.94]]},{"start":93.94,"end":99.54,"text":"terminology out of the presentation. Otherwise, a lot of the international students won't","words":[["terminology",93.94,94.62],["out",94.62,95.0],["of",95.0,95.16],["the",95.16,95.26],["presentation.",95.26,95.86],["Otherwise,",96.48,96.9],["a",97.38,97.6],["lot",97.6,97.74],["of",97.74,97.88],["the",97.88,98.0],["international",98.0,98.52],["students",98.52,99.2],["won't",99.2,99.54]]},{"start":99.54,"end":100.54,"text":"be able to follow us.","words":[["be",99.54,99.64],["able",99.64,99.8],["to",99.8,99.94],["follow",99.94,100.22],["us.",100.22,100.54]]},{"start":101.0,"end":106.54,"text":"That's a shame. I'm sure they'd be interested. I mean, I am. But, yeah, we wouldn't be able","words":[["That's",101.0,101.4],["a",101.4,101.48],["shame.",101.48,101.72],["I'm",101.82,101.92],["sure",101.92,102.12],["they'd",102.12,102.34],["be",102.34,102.44],["interested.",102.44,102.78],["I",103.46,103.74],["mean,",103.74,103.88],["I",104.08,104.22],["am.",104.22,104.46],["But,",104.78,104.96],["yeah,",105.2,105.44],["we",105.86,106.04],["wouldn't",106.04,106.22],["be",106.22,106.36],["able",106.36,106.54]]},{"start":106.54,"end":112.6,"text":"to explain it in the time allowed, so I guess we have to stick to English. Anyway, European","words":[["to",106.54,106.66],["explain",106.66,107.0],["it",107.0,107.24],["in",107.24,107.36],["the",107.36,107.48],["time",107.48,107.72],["allowed,",107.72,108.08],["so",108.1,108.46],["I",108.46,108.74],["guess",108.74,108.9],["we",108.9,109.06],["have",109.06,109.22],["to",109.22,109.34],["stick",109.34,109.52],["to",109.52,109.68],["English.",109.68,109.92],["Anyway,",110.94,111.42],["European",112.04,112.6]]},{"start":112.6,"end":117.2,"text":"migrants turned Stone Point into a lookout point for ships. Then it became a fort,","words":[["migrants",112.6,113.08],["turned",113.08,113.48],["Stone",113.48,113.78],["Point",113.78,114.08],["into",114.08,114.36],["a",114.36,114.56],["lookout",114.56,114.74],["point",114.74,115.12],["for",115.12,115.32],["ships.",115.32,115.66],["Then",116.18,116.4],["it",116.4,116.52],["became",116.52,116.74],["a",116.74,116.98],["fort,",116.98,117.2]]},{"start":117.2,"end":122.42,"text":"an army base in the late 1880s and then during the world wars the fort was","words":[["an",117.2,117.78],["army",117.78,118.08],["base",118.08,118.42],["in",118.42,118.64],["the",118.64,118.76],["late",118.76,118.92],["1880s",118.92,119.8],["and",119.8,120.42],["then",120.42,120.64],["during",120.64,120.94],["the",120.94,121.14],["world",121.14,121.36],["wars",121.36,121.82],["the",121.82,122.0],["fort",122.0,122.2],["was",122.2,122.42]]},{"start":122.42,"end":128.56,"text":"modernized again. It's also been a public park sometimes. I'd prefer to devote more","words":[["modernized",122.42,123.08],["again.",123.08,123.38],["It's",123.76,124.26],["also",124.26,124.62],["been",124.62,124.88],["a",124.88,125.06],["public",125.06,125.32],["park",125.32,125.78],["sometimes.",125.78,126.28],["I'd",127.46,127.64],["prefer",127.64,127.84],["to",127.84,128.06],["devote",128.06,128.3],["more",128.3,128.56]]},{"start":128.56,"end":132.52,"text":"of the presentation to the military use of Stonepoint. There are some great","words":[["of",128.56,128.7],["the",128.7,128.78],["presentation",128.78,129.18],["to",129.18,129.58],["the",129.58,129.68],["military",129.68,130.0],["use",130.0,130.36],["of",130.36,130.48],["Stonepoint.",130.48,131.0],["There",131.74,131.98],["are",131.98,132.06],["some",132.06,132.2],["great",132.2,132.52]]},{"start":132.52,"end":137.48,"text":"websites about the engines they installed. Sorry I wouldn't go into the","words":[["websites",132.52,133.0],["about",133.0,133.32],["the",133.32,133.5],["engines",133.5,133.84],["they",133.84,134.08],["installed.",134.08,134.46],["Sorry",135.32,135.82],["I",135.82,136.5],["wouldn't",136.5,136.86],["go",136.86,137.1],["into",137.1,137.28],["the",137.28,137.48]]},{"start":137.48,"end":142.4,"text":"technical side if I were you. If you start describing mechanical stuff people","words":[["technical",137.48,137.86],["side",137.86,138.3],["if",138.3,138.5],["I",138.5,138.62],["were",138.62,138.76],["you.",138.76,139.0],["If",139.68,139.86],["you",139.86,139.98],["start",139.98,140.2],["describing",140.2,140.88],["mechanical",140.88,141.3],["stuff",141.3,141.9],["people",141.9,142.4]]},{"start":142.4,"end":148.04,"text":"will switch off. I think it's more interesting to look at the impact Stonepoint had on the","words":[["will",142.4,142.62],["switch",142.62,142.84],["off.",142.84,143.2],["I",144.18,144.36],["think",144.36,144.54],["it's",144.54,144.76],["more",144.76,144.94],["interesting",144.94,145.4],["to",145.4,145.68],["look",145.68,145.82],["at",145.82,145.96],["the",145.96,146.08],["impact",146.08,146.56],["Stonepoint",146.56,147.4],["had",147.4,147.78],["on",147.78,147.92],["the",147.92,148.04]]},{"start":148.04,"end":155.12,"text":"people's lives at the time. I mean, for example, there were about 25 years when they used local","words":[["people's",148.04,148.44],["lives",148.44,148.72],["at",148.72,148.9],["the",148.9,148.98],["time.",148.98,149.34],["I",150.04,150.14],["mean,",150.14,150.3],["for",150.52,150.66],["example,",150.66,151.1],["there",151.62,152.06],["were",152.06,152.18],["about",152.18,152.44],["25",152.44,153.02],["years",153.02,153.52],["when",153.52,154.32],["they",154.32,154.46],["used",154.46,154.74],["local",154.74,155.12]]},{"start":155.12,"end":159.96,"text":"prisoners to build the tunnels and the underground rooms. They lived there too.","words":[["prisoners",155.12,155.58],["to",155.58,155.98],["build",155.98,156.24],["the",156.24,156.44],["tunnels",156.44,156.76],["and",156.76,157.38],["the",157.38,157.52],["underground",157.52,157.94],["rooms.",157.94,158.46],["They",159.0,159.2],["lived",159.2,159.46],["there",159.46,159.68],["too.",159.68,159.96]]},{"start":160.88,"end":163.92,"text":"Yeah, I guess, if we can find some first-hand accounts.","words":[["Yeah,",160.88,161.24],["I",161.42,161.54],["guess,",161.54,161.82],["if",162.24,162.44],["we",162.44,162.54],["can",162.54,162.66],["find",162.66,162.92],["some",162.92,163.08],["first",163.08,163.36],["-hand",163.36,163.58],["accounts.",163.58,163.92]]},{"start":167.35,"end":171.97,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["Before",167.35,167.81],["you",167.81,168.09],["hear",168.09,168.29],["the",168.29,168.45],["rest",168.45,168.71],["of",168.71,168.83],["the",168